  "body": "This is minor editorial, but the [definition of custom element state](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-custom-element-state) says it has `custom`, while [Upgrades](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#upgrades) section says `customized`.\n\nCan we pick one of them?\n",
